E1E3   B5 01                  LDA   1,X   
E1E5   D0 DC                  BNE   kt1   
E1E7   F0 C8                  BEQ   seta   ; always: the time ran out, A = 0
E1E9                             ; ---- no handler starts between here and the next heading --------------------
E1E9                             ; Backspace takes the last character back (and is echoed as it is), CR ends
E1E9                             ; (stored, not echoed), every other key is stored and echoed until the line
E1E9                             ; is full. Y = the length so far; T0 = the most allowed.
